WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Plugins, Add, Add custom MCP server (free plan works)

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:29.930
Name: Renoxium · https://www.renoxium.com/mcp · OAuth

3
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:37.430
Then: Create as a plugin, sign in to Renoxium, Allow

4
00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:58.500
Renoxium is installed

5
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Tip: Refresh tools when Renoxium adds new abilities

6
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:32.930
In a chat: + then Renoxium (or type @Renoxium) once

7
00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:41.930
"What apps do I have?"

8
00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:52.630
From now on ChatGPT uses Renoxium when you ask about your apps
